    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The return type, [`Timer.TimerPublisher`](timer/timerpublisher.md), conforms to [`ConnectablePublisher`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Combine/ConnectablePublisher), which means you must explicitly connect to the [`Timer`](timer.md) publisher to begin publishing events.",
      "normalizedSource": "The return type, [`Timer.TimerPublisher`](timer/timerpublisher.md), conforms to [`ConnectablePublisher`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Combine/ConnectablePublisher), which means you must explicitly connect to the [`Timer`](timer.md) publisher to begin publishing events.",
      "sourceHash": "abc5758638bcf784d218d0de60caa75b7bc2b0a77ece39f518b4cc9218a9f6f0",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "You can do this with a call to [`connect()`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Combine/ConnectablePublisher/connect()), or by using [`autoconnect()`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Combine/ConnectablePublisher/autoconnect()) to automatically connect when a subscriber attaches, as shown here:",
      "documentTitle": "publish(every:tolerance:on:in:options:)",
      "framework": "Foundation",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
